Good Morning Principal
<br /> &nbsp;
<br /> I hope that everyone’s Thanksgiving break was a wonderful chance to recharge and spend time thinking about things we are all thankful for.&nbsp; I know here at the Red Cross we are thankful for all the support we get from volunteer donors both financially and on the blood donor side.&nbsp; I would love to explore the potential of your school getting involved either this spring or looking out into the fall for next year with our pint-size hero program.&nbsp; I have included a brief overview for your review and look forward to speaking about it.
